# EAS Build project archive exclusions.
#
# server/.claude/skills and server/.windsurf/skills are symlinks into
# server/.agents/skills (Claude Code / Windsurf skill directories, unrelated
# to the app itself). EAS's local archiving tries to copy the symlinks
# verbatim on Windows, which fails with EPERM without elevated privileges.
# None of this is needed to build the app, so it's excluded outright.
server/.claude
server/.windsurf
